abstract: "An OpenAI-compatible policy gateway that sits in front of any LLM and enforces security policy on every request and response: it blocks secrets, redacts PII, flags prompt injection, applies per-key tunable detection profiles (auto/strict/balanced/quiet, with an optional local LLM judge) and budgets, and records every decision in an audit log."
